      "summary_cnt": "{pos} · {n} added",
      "hint": "Pick a position from the tabs, then click champions to add/remove them. A listed champion can play only the positions it is listed in. An unlisted champion is a free-reserve pick and is normally locked until a designated position pool is actually exhausted. See the rules panel for details.",
      "rules_title": "Position Lock rules",
      "rules_close": "Close",
      "rules_switch": "Rules on/off",
      "rules_open": "Rules",
      "rules_short": "■ Position rule\n· Listed champion → only the positions it is listed in\n· Unlisted champion → reserve pick; normally locked\n\n■ Safety check\n· Each position first uses the dynamic base for the current draft rule / ban count\n· Unrelated short positions do not increase another position's requirement\n· If the same champions are listed in multiple positions, only those overlapping positions are checked together with the shared-pool / subset rule\n\n■ Reserve fallback\n· Reserve champions stay locked while the remaining listed pool can still complete all 5 positions\n· If bans/picks/fearless locks actually exhaust a position, reserve champions open as emergency flexible picks\n· Champions listed for another position do NOT become free\n\n■ Draft · swap\n· Illegal picks are greyed out (hover for the reason)\n· Position masks stay strict through swap/AI assignment\n· Global fail-open remains only as the last emergency when no legal candidate exists\n\n■ Saving: changes apply at once; press 'OK' to save",
